d5f477289552d699720419ca9a8d350.poster.avif?t=1737520250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1423330/extras/1d5f477289552d699720419ca9a8d350.webm?t=1737520250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1423330/extras/1d5f477289552d699720419ca9a8d350.mp4?t=1737520250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MAKE A STRONGER EMPIRE</h2>Recover cities and territories once controlled by Frontier Command Headquarter. Establish friendly relations with lords in Western Regions and confront Xiongnu with them.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1423330/extras/2456ba0dcbf4964a0030c2837b352228.poster.avif?t=1737520250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1423330/extras/2456ba0dcbf4964a0030c2837b352228.webm?t=1737520250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1423330/extras/2456ba0dcbf4964a0030c2837b352228.mp4?t=1737520250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRAIN SOLDIERS</h2>Collect or produce equipment, train troops and choose the most appropriate arms to respond to complex battlefields.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1423330/extras/31c9c32e7ac35fd151b5bba229e3d55b.poster.avif?t=1737520250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1423330/extras/31c9c32e7ac35fd151b5bba229e3d55b.webm?t=1737520250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1423330/extras/31c9c32e7ac35fd151b5bba229e3d55b.mp4?t=1737520250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 c